<Base title="Contribute"><section class="shell editorial"><span class="eyebrow">CONTRIBUTE</span><h1>Help make scientific ideas explorable.</h1><p class="lead">Contributions currently arrive through reviewed pull requests to the platform repository.</p><h2>Propose an experiment</h2><p>Open an issue or pull request with the scientific model, intended controls, references, author attribution, source repository and license. Browser-compatible static builds are the target. An external project stays a candidate until its source revision, dependencies, artifact and browser behavior are reviewed.</p><h2>Improve an explanation</h2><p>Clarify assumptions, correct references or improve accessibility in the Markdown scientific notes. Please cite scientific claims and distinguish empirical observations from model results.</p><h2>Review and security</h2><p>Do not submit secrets or executable build commands in manifests. External code is not automatically built or published. See the <a href="https://github.com/selyaktini/simubox/blob/main/docs/SECURITY.md">security model</a> and <a href="https://github.com/selyaktini/simubox">repository</a>.</p></section></Base>
